WEBVTT

00:07.230 --> 00:08.520
Don't touch them, Annette!

00:09.110 --> 00:11.240
There are still traces of magic on them.

00:11.240 --> 00:12.530
We'll treat them later.

00:14.280 --> 00:17.200
He's definitely here.

00:20.120 --> 00:21.040
Let's go.

01:43.930 --> 01:47.430
<b>No Longer Allowed               in Another World</b>

01:47.430 --> 01:48.730
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

01:48.730 --> 01:52.020
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

02:07.060 --> 02:08.190
Bishop Wolff!

02:07.060 --> 02:08.190
Wolff!

02:09.730 --> 02:12.150
Why did you come here?

02:12.480 --> 02:15.230
Who are you?!

02:16.400 --> 02:18.320
My name is Yuriko.

02:18.780 --> 02:21.810
I am an Other Worlder who was 
once instructed by Wolff.

02:24.120 --> 02:29.500
Now people call me the 
Fallen Angel of Greed.

02:29.830 --> 02:31.720
A F-Fallen Angel?

02:32.290 --> 02:35.550
This time is for me and Wolff.

02:35.550 --> 02:37.180
Don't interrupt.

02:43.390 --> 02:45.210
Wh-What is this?

02:51.810 --> 02:53.630
They're coming!

02:58.030 --> 03:01.410
Please, Yuriko. Don't do this.

03:01.820 --> 03:04.070
"Don't falter in the face of your enemy."

03:04.070 --> 03:07.580
You once taught me that, Master.

03:09.920 --> 03:11.420
Grand Shield!

03:14.610 --> 03:15.460
Next!

03:19.670 --> 03:21.300
Lion's Blade!

03:23.050 --> 03:25.300
Hey, these are pretty nice.

03:25.300 --> 03:26.350
Tama!

03:32.900 --> 03:34.860
This has to be a joke!

03:37.320 --> 03:40.860
The battle will continue until you fall...

03:40.860 --> 03:44.320
because that is what I desire.

03:49.620 --> 03:53.500
This is my gift: Greed.

03:54.290 --> 03:55.330
Ysha!

04:00.090 --> 04:03.940
What happened between you and Wolff?

04:05.340 --> 04:08.760
Wolff must've been a passionate 
and skilled teacher!

04:08.760 --> 04:11.310
You should have no reason to hate him!

04:20.940 --> 04:22.560
You're working hard.

04:22.560 --> 04:24.040
M-Master.

04:27.320 --> 04:30.620
As I thought, your ability 
isn't suited to combat.

04:31.000 --> 04:32.750
Listen to me, Yuriko.

04:32.750 --> 04:35.830
It isn't absolutely necessary for Other 
Worlders to challenge the Dark Lord.

04:36.750 --> 04:38.790
You could live a normal life in this—

04:38.790 --> 04:43.300
No. Doesn't this world wish for 
the Dark Lord's destruction?

04:43.590 --> 04:45.800
Then I will fight.

04:45.800 --> 04:48.680
I see. You're a hard worker.

04:50.140 --> 04:53.730
I'm sure your strength will blossom someday.

04:54.390 --> 04:57.480
But don't push yourself too hard, okay?

04:58.020 --> 05:00.650
Yes, Master.

05:02.030 --> 05:04.650
He certainly was a good teacher.

05:05.740 --> 05:07.610
The days I devoted myself to training...

05:09.700 --> 05:11.540
What few breaks I took...

05:21.130 --> 05:22.250
Yuriko.

05:24.260 --> 05:27.670
They were all tremendously fulfilling.

05:30.220 --> 05:31.350
Until that day...

05:37.010 --> 05:38.980
Until she showed up.

05:49.990 --> 05:53.450
After she appeared, my master changed.

05:53.950 --> 05:58.250
Her prodigal talent led him to become 
preoccupied with teaching her,

05:58.250 --> 06:01.210
and he stopped giving me attention.

06:02.210 --> 06:05.010
Still, I devoted myself to my training...

06:07.470 --> 06:09.470
in order to defeat the Dark Lord.

06:10.510 --> 06:11.430
No...

06:12.350 --> 06:16.940
I simply did it so Wolff would look at me, but...

06:17.310 --> 06:18.810
Incredible!

06:19.310 --> 06:21.770
Truly, you are the hero who 
will defeat the Dark Lord!

06:26.150 --> 06:31.870
The world—no, I've been waiting 
all this time for you to appear!

06:46.130 --> 06:50.760
Ironically, that was when 
my own power blossomed.

06:50.760 --> 06:51.970
Don't, Yuriko!

06:51.970 --> 06:53.260
Don't do this!

06:57.100 --> 06:58.350
No...

07:10.280 --> 07:12.740
If the events of that day had never occurred,

07:12.740 --> 07:16.200
my power probably would've 
remained locked away forever.

07:16.620 --> 07:23.170
In that regard, you could say you 
taught me the correct way, Master.

07:28.380 --> 07:29.170
Huh?

07:29.170 --> 07:31.260
H-Have we been spared?

07:35.140 --> 07:40.230
Consumed by desire, 
I killed an innocent girl.

07:40.890 --> 07:42.980
I am no longer human.

07:43.650 --> 07:45.360
Th-That's...

07:49.360 --> 07:53.070
All that's left is to fall as far as I will.

07:54.070 --> 07:55.240
Run!

07:55.240 --> 07:57.030
Get away from this place!

07:57.490 --> 07:59.500
I want everyone to die.

07:59.790 --> 08:05.080
Don't!

08:19.010 --> 08:22.560
I know I requested a self-propelled bed,

08:24.480 --> 08:28.230
but the technical prowess of the nation 
of craftsmen is truly exceptional.

08:29.190 --> 08:30.650
Ah, forgive me.

08:32.070 --> 08:34.360
Were you in the middle of something?

08:43.710 --> 08:47.420
I see. You certainly do look similar.

08:48.250 --> 08:49.380
Melos.

09:06.270 --> 09:07.400
Are you...

09:08.860 --> 09:10.230
Hikari?

09:10.820 --> 09:16.240
I just finished writing your 
younger sister's story.

09:17.030 --> 09:20.870
Now it's your turn.

09:22.460 --> 09:26.340
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:22.960 --> 09:26.340
I Cannot Die
Until I've Finished
Writing Your Story

09:26.340 --> 09:27.210
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:26.380 --> 09:27.170
I Cannot Die
Until I've Finished
Writing Your Story

09:27.170 --> 09:27.210
I Cannot Die
Until I've Finished
Writing Your Story

09:27.210 --> 09:27.250
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:27.210 --> 09:27.250
I Cannot Die
Until I've Finished
Writing Your Story

09:27.290 --> 09:27.340
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:27.340 --> 09:27.430
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:27.430 --> 09:27.470
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:33.590 --> 09:35.170
Her sister?

09:35.170 --> 09:36.840
What's going on here?

09:37.380 --> 09:39.300
Those two are sisters?

09:41.010 --> 09:44.310
I hadn't introduced myself yet.

09:44.310 --> 09:45.850
I am an author.

09:46.270 --> 09:50.720
Your sister told me all about 
herself on the way here.

09:52.020 --> 09:55.440
How you were a close family of three.

09:57.200 --> 10:00.950
How your sister had been sickly 
since she was a child.

10:02.240 --> 10:07.370
How you stayed at her 
bedside and cared for her.

10:08.290 --> 10:14.000
My illness worsened day by day, 
but despite that, my sister...

10:15.170 --> 10:18.470
always stayed by my side and cared for me.

10:19.050 --> 10:23.890
She was so excited for high school, 
but she hardly got to go.

10:24.180 --> 10:25.310
Stop.

10:25.720 --> 10:30.810
Upon hearing her story, I was 
touched by your kindness, too.

10:30.810 --> 10:33.360
I thought you were like the holy mother.

10:36.280 --> 10:39.200
Speak no more.

10:41.030 --> 10:44.990
Ah, what a delightful sight.

10:45.240 --> 10:47.200
...is what I wish I could say.

10:48.910 --> 10:51.290
Let's let them handle this.

10:53.420 --> 10:55.460
Forgive me, miss.

10:56.130 --> 10:57.800
I am an author.

10:58.670 --> 11:04.930
I cannot die until I've 
finished writing your story.

11:04.930 --> 11:08.810
Stop this, sister! I know 
this isn't what you really—

11:08.810 --> 11:11.150
You know nothing.

11:11.440 --> 11:15.610
I'm a kind older sister? You must be joking.

11:17.480 --> 11:22.200
The truth is, I always hated you.

11:23.160 --> 11:26.790
You stole my youth from me.

11:30.410 --> 11:34.550
So I was happy when I arrived in this world.

11:35.340 --> 11:38.130
I thought my own life would finally begin.

11:39.260 --> 11:43.550
But then you showed up and took 
everything from me again.

11:44.800 --> 11:47.220
When that happened, I made a decision.

11:47.810 --> 11:51.060
You'll never get in my way again.

11:53.230 --> 11:55.190
I am greedy.

11:56.480 --> 11:58.980
I will acquire everything I want.

12:01.610 --> 12:03.240
I see.

12:03.240 --> 12:08.540
So, what is it that you wanted?

12:08.830 --> 12:09.480
Silence!

12:11.250 --> 12:12.870
Sensei!

12:22.380 --> 12:23.340
Wolff!

12:27.260 --> 12:30.310
Yuriko, I'm sorry.

12:31.270 --> 12:34.650
I had no idea you felt that way, but I...

12:35.060 --> 12:36.150
Hey, you.

12:36.980 --> 12:38.690
Stay out of this.

12:38.690 --> 12:39.440
Huh?

12:40.610 --> 12:45.410
You have no role to play in the 
story of love I wish to write.

12:46.660 --> 12:51.370
Stay there and be quiet, playboy.

12:52.160 --> 12:53.410
Now...

12:54.120 --> 12:56.120
Let's continue.

12:56.630 --> 13:00.700
What is it that you wanted?

13:00.700 --> 13:02.550
S-Stay away from me!

13:04.790 --> 13:06.050
Sensei!

13:10.220 --> 13:12.390
I am an author.

13:12.390 --> 13:15.310
I want to write what you truly feel.

13:25.900 --> 13:29.160
What I wanted...

13:34.660 --> 13:37.120
The cherry blossoms were 
in full bloom that day.

13:44.260 --> 13:46.220
Dad, today is my graduation cere—

13:46.220 --> 13:47.300
Look, Hikari.

13:47.300 --> 13:49.140
It's beautiful.

13:51.720 --> 13:52.890
What do you think?

13:52.890 --> 13:54.600
It looks great on you.

13:54.600 --> 13:56.230
Thanks, Dad.

13:57.140 --> 14:00.690
Get well soon so we can 
go out together, okay?

14:04.780 --> 14:09.200
I'm heading back to the office. 
Look after her, Yuriko.

14:09.200 --> 14:10.070
Okay.

14:18.370 --> 14:21.590
It's too bright, isn't it? 
Let's close the curtains.

14:26.170 --> 14:28.010
Congratulations. You worked hard.

14:28.380 --> 14:29.970
Thanks.

14:36.810 --> 14:38.340
"Congratulations."

14:47.150 --> 14:48.320
Hikari!

14:49.610 --> 14:51.820
Thank you very much.

14:51.820 --> 14:53.700
Take care.

14:57.870 --> 15:00.500
Dad, how's Hikari?

15:03.630 --> 15:06.460
What do you think happened 
while you were out having fun?

15:13.180 --> 15:16.720
Hikari could've died because of you!

15:17.180 --> 15:19.270
What do you think you're wearing?

15:22.400 --> 15:26.610
Hikari, it's all right. I'm here now.

15:39.830 --> 15:41.420
I just...

15:44.000 --> 15:46.590
wanted to be seen more.

15:52.930 --> 15:56.310
But that desire nearly killed my sister.

15:57.100 --> 16:01.350
And I repeated the same 
thing here in this world.

16:03.810 --> 16:07.610
I'm not a caring older sister.

16:10.860 --> 16:14.240
I'm greedy and hideous.

16:20.200 --> 16:23.540
So you wanted to be seen by someone.

16:31.300 --> 16:35.930
There isn't a person in this 
world who doesn't want that.

16:37.140 --> 16:39.220
You aren't greedy.

16:39.600 --> 16:44.280
You're just a kind girl who's a bit awkward.

16:47.650 --> 16:48.860
Hikari...

16:50.690 --> 16:52.150
I'm sorry.

16:52.150 --> 16:55.990
I had no idea. I'm so sorry.

16:55.990 --> 16:57.120
Yuriko-kun.

16:58.280 --> 17:03.370
Do you know why your sister 
was summoned to this world?

17:50.920 --> 17:57.260
Because she lost hope in a world without you.

18:03.970 --> 18:08.560
And though she is an old woman now,

18:08.560 --> 18:13.320
she followed you here just to see you again.

18:17.610 --> 18:19.780
<i>I've failed as a teacher.</i>

18:20.990 --> 18:24.830
Ah, hero. Welcome to Zauberberg.

18:24.830 --> 18:26.660
You have been chosen to save this—

18:26.660 --> 18:27.750
Hikari!

18:29.040 --> 18:30.670
Sister?

18:30.670 --> 18:32.710
How's your illness, Hikari?

18:32.710 --> 18:34.300
Come to think of it...

18:35.840 --> 18:37.680
My body feels so light.

18:40.470 --> 18:43.010
You don't have to suffer anymore.

18:43.010 --> 18:44.720
I'm so glad.

18:45.980 --> 18:47.850
Please, Wolff.

18:47.850 --> 18:51.560
I will become stronger so I can fight 
the Dark Lord or anything else.

18:51.560 --> 18:54.610
So please allow my sister to live freely.

18:54.610 --> 18:57.700
Sure, but why do you want that so badly?

18:58.200 --> 19:02.160
I took my sister's life from her.

19:02.450 --> 19:07.410
So this time, I want her to 
be happy in this world.

19:09.330 --> 19:13.920
You've always loved each other.

19:24.350 --> 19:28.210
What a beautiful story of love.

19:34.770 --> 19:37.610
<i>That's what the pope was talking about...</i>

19:38.490 --> 19:45.080
Such a beautiful story shouldn't 
be completed by my hand.

20:08.810 --> 20:09.980
What's this?

20:10.430 --> 20:15.400
You're probably meant to return 
to the place where you belong.

20:20.820 --> 20:23.610
Mr. Author, the rest of you...

20:24.110 --> 20:27.080
I'm sorry for the trouble I caused.

20:27.620 --> 20:29.160
Yuriko...

20:29.160 --> 20:31.410
And Master...

20:36.630 --> 20:40.460
Thank you for granting me a moment of youth.

20:47.220 --> 20:50.020
Sister, let's go home.

20:50.020 --> 20:51.850
Yes, Hikari.

21:20.730 --> 21:21.600
Sister?

21:23.190 --> 21:25.040
Good morning, Hikari.

21:25.390 --> 21:27.280
You must've slept well.

21:27.860 --> 21:30.450
You looked so happy in your sleep.

21:30.450 --> 21:31.650
Sister...

21:32.120 --> 21:35.390
I had a very long dream.

21:36.730 --> 21:38.930
Oh, what kind of dream?

21:39.580 --> 21:42.890
You'd laugh at me if I told you.

21:43.810 --> 21:45.370
Tell me.

21:46.060 --> 21:47.900
We have plenty of time.

22:01.790 --> 22:08.190
I dreamed about a faraway world 
different from this one.
